    },
    {
      "text": "learning V π",
      "bbox": [
        107.99996948242188,
        255.41453552246094,
        151.3916778564453,
        265.3087463378906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "c are both crucial components in our design and work in tandem to contribute to RESPO’s efficacy.",
      "bbox": [
        144.99795532226562,
        257.292724609375,
        503.28033447265625,
        266.8857116699219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "behavior that sacrifices reward performance. Ultimately, this ablation study experimentally highlights",
      "bbox": [
        107.99996948242188,
        289.49334716796875,
        504.0014343261719,
        298.39990234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the importance of learning our REF and using value function V π",
      "bbox": [
